Package: shellos-branding
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, base-files, plymouth, plymouth-label
Description: ShellOS identity: os-release, artwork, boot splash, desktop defaults
 Replaces Debian's os-release and issue files (via dpkg-divert), and ships
 the ShellOS spiral logo, wallpaper, Plymouth theme, Limine wallpaper and
 COSMIC defaults (dark mode, teal #2EC4B6 accent).
